## Version 2
Added the following instruction:

"For store-hours questions, always use the Store Hours
subagent and its configured Flow action to retrieve the
schedule. Never guess or invent operating hours."

## Preview Comparison

Test question:
What are NovaHome's store opening hours?

| Check | Version 1 | Version 2 |
|---|---|---|
| Store Hours subagent | Passed | Passed |
| Flow action | Passed | Passed |
| Correct schedule | Passed | Passed |
| Output evaluation | GROUNDED | GROUNDED |

## Difference
Version 1 uses the original instructions.
Version 2 explicitly requires Store Hours questions
to use the Store Hours subagent and Flow action.

Both versions returned the correct grounded response.
No behavioral difference was observed in this test.

